{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Like fat</b> — כמו as in את חלב הארץ, and it comes deficient of the bet in שבעתי אילים." "<b>And the meaning of my lips shall rejoice</b> — that I shall rejoice to you in every tongue I know, or that my mouth praising you shall be the cause that every tongue shall rejoice to you, and this is connected with what comes after it."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 63, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:36.735753510Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}